r modes including Free For All, No Guns, Team Deathmatch and Gold Rush!<br></li><li>Single Player Bots - Battle against or along-side clever AI bots so you're never alone!<br></li><li>Interact with Everything - Grab whatever you can get your hands on, and use it in battle! (Pro Tip - a throwing knife deals more damage than a poker chip;)<br></li><li>Hang Out - Hit the saloon to have a virtual drink with a fellow Cowbot, make art out of a stack of chairs or join a battle. No consequences in this social area.<br></li><li>Customize your Avatar - Unlock cool gear to outfit your Cowbot or Alien with hats, shirts, vests or facial hair!<br></li><li>Master Creative Weapons - The Cowbots and Aliens have retrofitted the iconic weapons of the old west for use in their ongoing feud. From guns to tomahawks to broken bottles - the Cowbots and Aliens have em all.<br></li><li>Wreck the Place! - Don’t hesitate to make a mess - this is the Wild West, after all.</li></ul><br><strong>Get ready for wild sci-western, shooter action that you can play alone or with your friends online!</strong><br><br> Available for Arcades on SpringboardVR ",
